    lines: list[str] = ["# TrackOCD ICLR 2027 — Phase25 MOT-preserving Proposal Set/Source Generalization", "", f"**Execution (UTC):** `{decision['execution_time']}`  ", "**Gate P2:** **PARTIAL**  ", "**Decision:** `P25_GATE_P2_PARTIAL_STOP_BEFORE_CORRESPONDENCE`", "", "## Executive result", "", f"Phase25 kept the physical MOT stream frozen and reproduced Phase24 exactly: raw prefix16 true-IoU ceiling **25/76**, the 27-transform causal candidate-pool oracle **38/76** (diagnostic only), and Phase24 set-aware top20 **32/76**.  The new one-block attention selector was trained on four disjoint TRAIN folds and its best real condition, attention top27, reached **{best_d['ceiling_correct']}/76** (source {best_d['source_reliable_events']}, target {best_d['target_reliable_events']}; fold {[x['ceiling_correct'] for x in best_d['by_fold']]})**.  It is below 38/76 and improves only {stage3['gate_p2']['folds_improved']}/4 folds, so Gate P2 is PARTIAL and the branch stops before correspondence, controller, backbone or public evaluation.", "", "## Scope, sealing and frozen comparator", "", "Only public TRAIN-derived rows/GT/category/video metadata and the inherited 76 positive pseudo-held event manifest were used.  DEV+, Q1, public new-model labels, future frames/tracks, physical/semantic IDs and text were not read.  The Phase19R evaluator, row keys, denominator, causal chronology and physical stream were read-only.  No public/Q1 output was created.", "", "## Phase24 regression and Stage0 failure taxonomy", "", f"Independent Phase25 counting gives raw {stage0_rep['raw_prefix16']}/76, candidate-pool oracle {stage0_rep['candidate_pool_oracle_prefix16']}/76 and Phase24 setaware top20 {stage0_rep['setaware_top20_prefix16']}/76.  The 44 set-aware failures are classified as follows:", "", "| class | events |", "|---|---:|"]
    for k, v in sorted(stage0["failure_class_counts"].items()): lines.append(f"| {k} | {v} |")
    lines += ["", "The pool has both-side reliable candidates for six selector failures (three source-side and three target-side not retained); 11 events are source-side pool failures, 22 target-side, and five have no reliable candidate on either side.  Candidate counts, raw/pool/selected IoUs, parent frame/transform, area, history stability and causal materialization for every event are in [`failure_taxonomy_76.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/failure_taxonomy_76.json).  Fold/category/video aggregates are in [`fold_shift_report.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/fold_shift_report.json).", "", "## Stage1 unified proposal-set strategies", "", *prefix_table(stage1, ["raw_baseline", "phase24_setaware_top20", "confidence_calibrated_top20", "history_consistent_top20", "full_candidate_diagnostic"]), "", "The fixed candidate pool retains 38/76 only as an oracle diagnostic.  Confidence-calibrated top20 reaches 34/76 and history-consistent top20 33/76.  Increasing retention and the raw-preserving fallback therefore does not establish a learned proposal result.  Full records and candidate recall@0.3/0.5/0.7 are in [`stage1_unified_strategies.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/metrics/stage1_unified_strategies.json).", "", "### MOT compatibility", "", f"The proposal-only evaluator preserves physical IDs and row order exactly: track continuity ratio {mot['track_continuity_ratio']:.3f}, duplicate tracks created {mot['duplicate_tracks_created']}, fragmentation delta {mot['fragmentation_delta']}, and parent-assignment mismatches {mot['parent_assignment_mismatch_count']}/{mot['parent_assignment_checks']}.  A standard MOTA/IDF1/HOTA rerun is not exposed by this proposal-only interface; no MOT metric is claimed.  The structural invariants are exact and recorded in [`mot_compatibility.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/mot_compatibility.json).", "", "## Stage2A attention selector", "", "The candidate pool met the preregistered 38/76 condition, so no source/candidate generator branch was launched.  The single new selector differs from Phase24's masked mean/max MLP: LayerNorm/linear key-aligned CLS+ROI and 22-dimensional causal geometry feed one two-head self-attention block with residual FFN, quality head and uncertainty head.  Model inputs exclude GT, IoU, category/physical/semantic IDs, text, future frames/tracks and StateMemory.  Training used four video/category-disjoint TRAIN folds, group-balanced category sampling, seed 20260829+fold, BF16, batch 32, AdamW 3e-4/1e-4, 4,000 updates and checkpoints every 500.  The fixed loss was IoU-soft listwise + 0.50 quality + 0.25 same-row hard-negative margin + 0.10 uncertainty calibration; K={5,10,20,27} was frozen before held-event evaluation.", "", "| fold | fit rows | val rows | best step | val top5@0.5 | val top20@0.5 | val top27@0.5 | ECE | checkpoint |", "|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|"]
