    failed = [r["event_key"] for r in event_rows if not r["phase25_attention_top27_ceiling"]]
    lines += ["", f"Attention top27 failed-event keys ({len(failed)}/76) are retained exactly in the CSV and Stage3 JSON: `" + ", ".join(failed) + "`.", "", "## Gate P2 and stop decision", "", "* Threshold: real learned proposal prefix16 ≥38/76; attention top27 = **%d/76** → fail threshold." % best_d["ceiling_correct"], "* Source/target: raw %d/%d → attention top27 %d/%d; both sides improve, but this is insufficient without the threshold and fold criteria." % (raw_d["source_reliable_events"], raw_d["target_reliable_events"], best_d["source_reliable_events"], best_d["target_reliable_events"]), "* Fold direction: raw %s → attention top27 %s; only %d/4 folds improve." % ([x["ceiling_correct"] for x in raw_d["by_fold"]], [x["ceiling_correct"] for x in best_d["by_fold"]], stage3["gate_p2"]["folds_improved"]), "* Candidate pool 38/76 and GT-tight 73/76 are diagnostics only, never learned proposal results.", "", "Gate P2 is **PARTIAL** (`P25_GATE_P2_PARTIAL_STOP_BEFORE_CORRESPONDENCE`).  Do not enter correspondence, StateMemory/controller, threshold tuning, modern backbone or public/Q1 evaluation.  The candidate-source branch was not registered after Stage0/1 confirmed the pool coverage condition; the remaining evidence is selection/domain generalization, not a reason to claim final OCD success.", "", "## Resources, incidents, storage and sealing", "", "Launch preflight immediately before the bounded supervisor recorded 99 GiB available of 125 GiB RAM, `/data1` 21 GiB free, GPUs 4–7 idle, and external GPU0–3 processes untouched.  Four workers ran one fold per physical GPU with an explicit `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`/expected-GPU assertion; supervisor PID 37538 and workers 37553–37556 exited naturally.  No OOM, swap, near-OOM, duplicate launch or external process termination occurred.  Postflight is [`resource_postflight.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/resource_postflight.json).", "", "The first attention smoke retained `.launched` without `.done` because `box_y2_norm` was omitted (21/22 geometry dimensions); the field was restored, manifests rebuilt, and a new smoke plus targeted regression passed.  Three Stage1 code-only repairs (syntax, condition dispatch, raw fallback indexing) were smoke/regression-tested before the complete run; Phase24 artifacts were never modified.  These incidents and PIDs are machine-recorded in [`phase25_decision.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/phase25_decision.json).", "", "Frozen inputs were reused by symlink without copying: `data/iclr27_phase19r/sources/public_rows_corrected.csv` → `data/iclr27_phase19/sources/public_rows_corrected.csv`; `data/iclr27_phase19r/sources/public_cls_roi.npz` → `data/iclr27_phase19/sources/public_cls_roi.npz`.  Resolved targets, hashes and required-path checks are in [`integrity.json`](../../outputs/iclr27_phase25/audit/integrity.json).", "", "## Reproduction", "", "```bash", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/run_stage0_audit.py", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/run_stage1_unified_strategies.py", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/build_set_manifests.py", "PYTHONPATH=. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/train_set_selector.py --fold 0 --device cuda:0 --expected-physical-gpu 4 --smoke --tag attention_smoke_fix", "PYTHONPATH=. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/train_set_selector.py --fold 0 --device cuda:0 --expected-physical-gpu 4 --steps 10 --batch-size 16 --checkpoint-every 5 --tag attention_targeted_fix", "PYTHONPATH=. bash scripts/iclr27_phase25/run_four_fold_setaware_supervisor.sh", "PYTHONPATH=. CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/evaluate_stage3.py", "PYTHONPATH=. /home/lwr/anaconda3/envs/locatemot/bin/python scripts/iclr27_phase25/finalize_phase25.py", "```", "", "## Final recommendation", "", "Phase25 provides a reliable MOT-preserving negative/partial result: the fixed candidate pool contains useful coverage, but a new class-agnostic set selector does not generalize enough across held videos/categories (30/76, 2/4 folds).  The next research step should be proposal-domain/source generalization or a revision of the pseudo-held task that independently identifies coverage versus selection; do not tune the current OCD controller or treat candidate/GT oracles as success.", ""]
